SUMMARY:All is Vibration:  The Quantum Nature of Reality
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n**All Is Vibration:**\n*
 *The Quantum Nature of Reality**\nMystical Seekers Series Presentation\n\n
 Written by Julian Johnson\, F.R.C.\nRosicrucian Digest #2 2025\n\nFree Adm
 ission - Refreshments - Open to the public\n\nModern quantum physics revea
 ls that all matter is essentially motion. There is no true solidity—just
  patterns of energy interacting with our senses. Ancient Rosicrucian teach
 ings long anticipated this view\, asserting that spirit energy lies at the
  root of all existence\, vibrating at different frequencies to form the mu
 ltiplicity of things we experience.\n\nJoin us to learn how practice and w
 ith a clear understanding of this concept one may develop the ability to g
 o beyond the 5 senses and perceive auras\, telepathy and remote viewing.\n
 \nFrater Dan Villalva\, F.R.C. will present this article and facilitate th
 e discussion.\n\nAbout the Santa Rosa Pronaos\nWe hold a monthly public pr
 esentation on mystical or metaphysical topics as a public service. The top
 ics and speakers vary and no previous knowledge or experience is required.
  Just bring an open mind and heart.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos doesn't char
 ge for admission. We operate under the law of AMRA. You may give as your h
 eart and mind direct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational
  non-profit\, an affiliated body of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge fo
 r the Americas and the Caribbean.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31430
 8714/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260416T033036Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260416T033036Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
